  "id": "alpha",
  "term": "alpha",
  "definition": "In this context, alpha refers to the alpha rhythm seen on an EEG, a pattern of brain activity that typically becomes weaker when the eyes are opened. Changes in this alpha response, called alpha reactivity, have been studied as a possible marker of cognitive aging and some dementias.",
